Reason: cardinal directions have exact clamped sine and cosine values.
Use the shortcut with double reals; preserve original general-angle, non-finite and float-real expressions.
Upstream: speed only for double-real builds. Retire this patch when merged.

--- a/src/instance.c
+++ b/src/instance.c
@@ -195,8 +195,29 @@
 
